{"name":"Programs: fetch over UDP","description":"Test demo: fetch, verify and run a signed program from the host","kind":"fetch","entry":"fetch.txt","args":["10.0.2.2:7002","03e489240a78d8a85713f5b6d22749632d8268e238c40b9aca99f54c44de11828d","fib-and-primes"]}This app holds no program. It fetches the program its args name from the
server its args give, over UDP, checks the manifest signature against the
signer key of its args and every block hash, then runs the program.
See docs/ProgramDistribution.md.
